{"suttaId":"thag3.16","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1306,1324],"vripara":"264"},"segments":{"thag3.16:0.4":"Vimalattheragāthā","thag3.16:1.1":"“Pāpamitte vivajjetvā, bhajeyyuttamapuggalaṃ;","thag3.16:1.3":"Ovāde cassa tiṭṭheyya, patthento acalaṃ sukhaṃ.","thag3.16:2.1":"“Parittaṃ dārumāruyha, yathā sīde mahaṇṇave;","thag3.16:2.3":"Evaṃ kusītamāgamma, sādhujīvīpi sīdati;","thag3.16:2.5":"Tasmā taṃ parivajjeyya, kusītaṃ hīnavīriyaṃ.","thag3.16:3.1":"“Pavivittehi ariyehi, pahitattehi jhāyibhi;","thag3.16:3.3":"Niccaṃ āraddhavīriyehi, paṇḍitehi sahāvase”ti.","thag3.16:3.5":"… Vimalo thero ….","thag3.16:3.6":"Tikanipāto niṭṭhito.","thag3.16:4.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag3.16:4.1":"Aṅgaṇiko bhāradvājo, paccayo bākulo isi;","thag3.16:4.3":"Dhaniyo mātaṅgaputto, sobhito vāraṇo isi.","thag3.16:5.1":"Vassiko ca yasojo ca, sāṭimattiyupāli ca;","thag3.16:5.3":"Uttarapālo abhibhūto, gotamo hāritopi ca.","thag3.16:6.1":"Thero tikanipātamhi, nibbāne vimalo kato;","thag3.16:6.3":"Aṭṭhatālīsa gāthāyo, therā soḷasa kittitāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
